  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "zJdq2-_DGJ62WZBdBBCKy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 345.6551857830525,
      "y": 907.046588421016,
      "width": 341.31534881543297,
      "height": 49.49309988861258,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "Zu",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1069368737,
      "version": 469,
      "versionNonce": 1650265967,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787599785288,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PID (Process ID): The process thinks it is PID\n1 (the system's init process). It cannot see\nprocesses running outside its namespace.",
      "fontSize": 13.198159970296686,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PID (Process ID): The process thinks it is PID 1 (the system's init process). It cannot see processes running outside its namespace.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iDCUxzMWSdIDbwlFhzIu4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 345.6551853012489,
      "y": 962.9859162132585,
      "width": 344.89127179878636,
      "height": 49.49309988861258,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "Zv",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 433856751,
      "version": 556,
      "versionNonce": 299345327,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787600226572,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NET (Network): The process gets its own\nisolated network stack (IP addresses, routing\ntables, ports).",
      "fontSize": 13.198159970296686,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NET (Network): The process gets its own isolated network stack (IP addresses, routing tables, ports).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mKWoB23EwzHpIkSHXZ9hs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 345.65518547202583,
      "y": 1016.9477964347107,
      "width": 336.7382644189786,
      "height": 32.99539992574172,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "Zw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 438692225,
      "version": 582,
      "versionNonce": 1967424111,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787602010013,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MNT (Mount): The process has its own isolated\nview of the filesystem mount points.",
      "fontSize": 13.198159970296688,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MNT (Mount): The process has its own isolated view of the filesystem mount points.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qgtbNghBPn45f_KfDfjil",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 773.1788196671297,
      "y": 876.488083474328,
      "width": 336.7382644189786,
      "height": 32.99539992574172,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ZwV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1947372577,
      "version": 719,
      "versionNonce": 2110338127,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787603891806,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cgroups keep track of everything a process\nconsumes and enforce strict ceilings.",
      "fontSize": 13.198159970296688,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Cgroups keep track of everything a process consumes and enforce strict ceilings.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Iwm2rUrhFMtHwrddqvuGv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 769.0591751518806,
      "y": 934.3883650672158,
      "width": 347.17621047165267,
      "height": 198.11426137719644,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "Zwl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 384015873,
      "version": 1005,
      "versionNonce": 844971503,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787602279314,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 🧠Memory (RAM): Sets a hard limit on RAM usage. If a\ncontainer exceeds its limit, the kernel activates the OOM (Out-\nOf-Memory) Killer 🛑 to instantly terminate the container's\nprocesses and protect the host from crashing.\n\n2. ⚡CPU: Allocates processing time shares or hard quotas.\nUnlike memory, if a container tries to use too much CPU, the\nkernel simply throttles (slows down) the container rather than\nkilling it.\n\n3. 💾Block I/O (Disk): Limits how fast a container can read and\nwrite to physical storage drives (I/O operations per second or\nMB/s).\n\n4. 🔢PIDs Limit: Caps the total number of processes a container\ncan create to prevent \"fork bombs\" from freezing the system.",
      "fontSize": 9.905713068859828,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 🧠Memory (RAM): Sets a hard limit on RAM usage. If a container exceeds its limit, the kernel activates the OOM (Out-Of-Memory) Killer 🛑 to instantly terminate the container's processes and protect the host from crashing.\n\n2. ⚡CPU: Allocates processing time shares or hard quotas. Unlike memory, if a container tries to use too much CPU, the kernel simply throttles (slows down) the container rather than killing it.\n\n3. 💾Block I/O (Disk): Limits how fast a container can read and write to physical storage drives (I/O operations per second or MB/s).\n\n4. 🔢PIDs Limit: Caps the total number of processes a container can create to prevent \"fork bombs\" from freezing the system.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "h_7rEcBbZBd-D4w01jqgB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 346.339291998792,
      "y": 1054.411976517043,
      "width": 351.9767715636147,
      "height": 32.99539992574172,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "Zx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1923623695,
      "version": 531,
      "versionNonce": 1338603105,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787598366624,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UTS (UNIX Timesharing System): The process gets\nits own separate hostname and domain name.",
      "fontSize": 13.198159970296688,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "UTS (UNIX Timesharing System): The process gets its own separate hostname and domain name.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-Bx8KDDNWBkTpcyJ_ESwN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 346.33929226892764,
      "y": 1093.5940143722319,
      "width": 355.3794912727588,
      "height": 65.99079985148344,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "Zy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 193925473,
      "version": 572,
      "versionNonce": 1659765313,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787598366624,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IPC (Inter-Process Communication): Prevents\nprocesses in one container from communicating\ndirectly with processes in another using shared\nmemory.",
      "fontSize": 13.198159970296688,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "IPC (Inter-Process Communication): Prevents processes in one container from communicating directly with processes in another using shared memory.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HVdMPz2CKtFbgnnUHz8W4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 344.96057138144647,
      "y": 1165.7714520550562,
      "width": 328.33126559194085,
      "height": 65.99079985148344,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "Zz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 95285551,
      "version": 619,
      "versionNonce": 1565921825,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787598366624,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "USER: Allows a process to be the \"root\" user\ninside the container, but a normal,\nunprivileged user on the actual host machine\n(crucial for security).",
      "fontSize": 13.198159970296686,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "USER: Allows a process to be the \"root\" user inside the container, but a normal, unprivileged user on the actual host machine (crucial for security).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
