      "versionNonce": 469567599,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787612031798,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔗 Bind Mount: You tell Docker the\nexact, hardcoded folder path on your\nhost machine to use (e.g.,\n/home/khalid/my_project_data). You are\nresponsible for creating the folder,\nmanaging its security permissions, and\nmaking sure that specific path exists.",
      "fontSize": 3.3498915575228887,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔗 Bind Mount: You tell Docker the exact, hardcoded folder path on your host machine to use (e.g., /home/khalid/my_project_data). You are responsible for creating the folder, managing its security permissions, and making sure that specific path exists.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gZSy26n4AZnJqDkwdbj8C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1802.5199322862877,
      "y": 779.341515434317,
      "width": 66.55142855578102,
      "height": 33.49891557522888,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#fa5252",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2007189743,
      "version": 501,
      "versionNonce": 1598038671,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787612031798,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "📦 Named Volume: You just give Docker a\nsimple name (like mariadb_data). Docker\nautomatically creates and manages a\nhidden, protected folder inside its own\ninternal system directory (usually\n/var/lib/docker/volumes/). Docker\ncompletely controls the permissions and\nthe storage location.",
      "fontSize": 3.3498915575228887,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "📦 Named Volume: You just give Docker a simple name (like mariadb_data). Docker automatically creates and manages a hidden, protected folder inside its own internal system directory (usually /var/lib/docker/volumes/). Docker completely controls the permissions and the storage location.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MMO0NMpHeiQtnsd35tLvW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1730.8097702986079,
      "y": 818.4171601615091,
      "width": 114.87479759188889,
      "height": 16.359241796800802,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#fa5252",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
